 "description": "Located in the heart of the vibrant Hillhead area of Glasgow, this stunning three-bedroom apartment has been meticulously upgraded by the current owner and is stylish and modern throughout.\n\n\rThe location offers easy access to some of the city’s most popular amenities, with Byres Road and Great Western Road within close reach. Therefore, a wonderful selection of bars, restaurants cafes and shops are just minutes away. The nearby Botanic Gardens and Kelvingrove Park provide attractive green spaces for walking, relaxing and enjoying the outdoors. Excellent transport links make Cranworth Street particularly convenient for commuters and city living. Kelvinbridge and Hillhead Subway stations are nearby, providing quick connections into Glasgow city centre and beyond, while regular bus services operate throughout the West End and surrounding areas. The area is also popular with students and professionals, with the University of Glasgow close by. Internally, the flat has been upgraded an excellent standard whilst maintaining many eye-catching period features.\n\nIn brief, the accommodation extends to; welcoming entrance hallway with storage cupboards off, spacious bay windowed living room with log burner and striking ceiling plasterwork. The kitchen has been completely re-fitted and has base and wall mounted units with tiled splash back, integrated appliances and utility room off. There are three bedrooms, all of which are generous doubles including the principal room which also has a walk-in wardrobe. The accommodation is completed by a fully tiled shower room with enclosed cubicle. To the rear of the building there are especially leafy communal gardens which make a fantastic space to relax or entertain.",
